  "method": "Survey-balanced ridge regression predicts a normalized perimeter position from WEAR-only BMI, breadth, depth, height, and sex features; hips additionally use absolute geometry features selected by anonymous entire-survey holdout. The position is converted to a superellipse exponent between 1.2 and 4.0. Named sizing-lab profiles and answers are excluded.",
